ass=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M19 14h-3v7h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">رزین اینفیلتریشن — درمان ضایعات سفید</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> پادکست</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"insight\">\n        <a href=\"/insight/insight-23.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/> <path d=\"M10 22h4\"/> <path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-4 12.7c.8.8 1 1.5 1 2.3h6c0-.8.2-1.5 1-2.3A7 7 0 0 0 12 2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">وقتی رادیولوسنسی زیر ترمیم، پوسیدگی نیست</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> اینسایت</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"pillar-card-fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"pillar-card\" data-subtopic=\"cracked-tooth\">\n    <summary class=\"pillar-card-summary\">\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.4 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z\"/> <path d=\"M12 9v5\"/> <path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/></svg></span>\n      <h2 class=\"pillar-card-title\">ترک و آسیبِ ساختاریِ دندان</h2>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-count\" aria-label=\"۴ مورد\">(۴)</span>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▾</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"pillar-card-body\">\n      <p class=\"pillar-subtopic-intro\">تشخیصِ آنچه چشمِ غیرمسلح نمی‌بیند. تمایزِ <strong>ترک‌های بی‌خطر از فرکچرهای ساختاری</strong>، و تعیینِ نقاطِ پایانیِ حذفِ ترک (CrRE) — مرزِ میانِ حفظِ دندان و شکستِ پیش‌رونده.</p>\n      <ul class=\"pillar-list\">\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-1.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">DentAI — انواع ترک مینایی: تشخیص و درمان ترمیمی</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-13.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\"> تشخیص آسیبهای ساختاری دندان </span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-14.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\"> انواع ترک دندان و نحوه ی تشخیص  </span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-15.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">تشریح ترک دندان و نقاط پایانی حذف ترک (CrRE)</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"pillar-card-fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"pillar-card\" data-subtopic=\"direct-restorations\">\n    <summary class=\"pillar-card-summary\">\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8.5 3.5c1.2 0 2 .6 3.5.6s2.3-.6 3.5-.6c2 0 3.5 1.6 3.5 4 0 2.8-1.5 4.4-2.2 7.4-.7 3-1.4 5.6-3 5.6-1.2 0-1.1-3.5-1.8-3.5s-.6 3.5-1.8 3.5c-1.6 0-2.3-2.6-3-5.6C6.5 11.9 5 10.3 5 7.5c0-2.4 1.5-4 3.5-4z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h2 class=\"pillar-card-title\">ترمیمِ مستقیم و مواد</h2>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-count\" aria-label=\"۷ مورد\">(۷)</span>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▾</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"pillar-card-body\">\n      <p class=\"pillar-subtopic-intro\">وقتی بافت رفته، چه چیزی جایش بنشیند؟ طراحیِ حفره برای <strong>مقاومت به شکست</strong>، و انتخابِ موادِ ترمیمِ مستقیم — جایی که شیمیِ ماده و طراحیِ مکانیکی با هم طولِ عمرِ ترمیم را رقم می‌زنند.</p>\n      <ul class=\"pillar-list\">\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"glossary\">\n        <a href=\"/glossary/isolation.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/> <path d=\"M4 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">Isolation</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> گلاسری</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"glossary\">\n        <a href=\"/glossary/matrix-in-matrix.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/> <path d=\"M4 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">Matrix-in-Matrix Technique</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> گلاسری</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"glossary\">\n        <a href=\"/glossary/microleakage.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/> <path d=\"M4 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">Microleakage</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> گلاسری</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"glossary\">\n        <a href=\"/glossary/rubber-dam.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/> <path d=\"M4 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">Rubber Dam</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> گلاسری</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-22.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">آمالگام در برابر کامپوزیت: جدیدترین متاآنالیز ۲۰۲۵ و پرسش تعویض آمالگام‌های سالم</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"podcast\">\n        <a href=\"/episodes/episode-128-2.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M19 14h-3v7h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">اینسایت — طراحی تراش و مقاومت به شکست (کامپوزیت)</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> پادکست</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"podcast\">\n        <a href=\"/episodes/episode-147-3.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M19 14h-3v7h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">دنتوپدیا — بررسی ماده Stela Automix</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> پادکست</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"pillar-card-fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n"}
